					"nextDialogs": [
						718030504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718030504,
					"content": "稍等，我把那份委托拿出来，对比一下特征。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岚姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030505,
					"content": "我看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岚姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030506,
					"content": "大部分都符合…看来它确实是那份委托要找的猫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岚姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030508,
					"content": "委托人会很高兴的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718030509,
					"content": "呼…兜兜转转一大圈，居然又转回了找猫这种委托。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岚姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030510,
					"content": "真是让人不知道说什么好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岚姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030511,
					"content": "我会把这两份委托分别向委托人报告，辛苦你了，这是报酬，请收下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岚姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030512,
					"content": "但那份找猫的委托…委托人似乎已经搬家了，联系到他们也许还需要一点时间。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岚姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030513,
					"content": "在委托人过来之前，这个小家伙，就由我先照顾着吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030514
